    <solution><p>To change a percentage to a decimal, we move the decimal to the left twice.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 535\% = {5.35} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 53.5\% = {0.535} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 5.35\% = {0.0535} }</m></p>
</solution>
